---
description: Find possible agreement terms within the supplied community scope and qualified-support boundary.
args: { dossier: MediationDossier; positions: MediationPosition[]; change: MediationChange }
returns: CommunityOption[]
---
Generate options from the participants' expressed interests and supplied rules. State who benefits, who bears a cost, what remains unresolved and which term is reversible. Route legal rights and immediate safety concerns to appropriate qualified support; do not propose a compromise that waives those rights or manages the hazard.
